msgctxt "scenario:scenario_341AB355_BE5B_4E05_AC1B_2B371462CADF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Up until his last breath, he was only ever concerned about me...⟪k:5⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Вплоть до своего последнего вздоха, единственная, о ком он думал, была "
"я...⟪k:5⟫"

#: scenario:scenario_2A406CDD_F42A_45A1_8E17_FF507700BE9C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 28d8dad07be55385ee1b242c20f297f9d9fd7b1b3ea2fd4330e98d6323068e60
